<title>JAPAN: Hokuetsu Industries - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hokuetsu Industries - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.42		vs	   14.19</p>
<p> Operating	  940    million    vs	  408    million</p>
<p> Current	    750    million    vs	  307    million</p>
<p> Net		  681    million    vs	  102    million</p>
<p> EPS		   22.59 yen	  vs	    3.40 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     30 million	  vs	  30 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Hokuetsu Industries Co Ltd boasts a major market share in mobile-type compressors.</p>
</text>
